 ional-curatorial-residency-program-2027-2/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Fabra i Coats\, Sant Andreu\, Barcelona\, Spain. Open to internati
 onal curators\; proposals limited to Europe\, the Mediterranean and North 
 Africa.
